criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Over 18 years old;
* Traumatic or non-traumatic non-progressive SCI;
* SCI levels C1- L5
* 6 months (± 4 weeks) since discharge after 1st admission from specialist SCI centre;
* Mobilise using either powered or manual wheelchair or walking, or a combination;
* Ability to travel to specialist SCI centre;

Exclusion Criteria:

* Unable to understand English;
* Lack capacity to provide informed consent
* Currently taking part in a clinical research trial
